questions.stem:
Consider the following procedure.

```text
PROCEDURE find(list, limit)
{
   FOR EACH item IN list
   {
      IF (item > limit)
      {
         RETURN (item)
      }
   }
   RETURN (-1)
}
```

What is returned by `find([21, 7, 15, 29, 22, 15], 16)`?

The following code segment is intended to display the number of elements in `nums` that are greater than 7.

```text
count ← 0
FOR EACH n IN nums
{
   IF (n ≥ 7)
   {
      count ← count + 1
   }
}
DISPLAY (count)
```

When `nums` is `[16, 13, 20, 7, 3]`, the code displays 4 instead of 3. Which change corrects the error?

